  B.push({ p: "**Why this objective exists.** \"_The tester **must be capable of communicating to all stakeholders the rationale behind the performance testing approach and the activities to be undertaken** (as detailed in the Performance Test Plan). **The subjects to be addressed in this communication may vary considerably between stakeholders** depending on whether they have a **\"business / user-facing\" interest** or a more **\"technology / operations-facing\" focus**._\"" });
